SUMMARY:Enniamera of the Virgin at Zoodochos Pigi\, Kotsinas
LOCATION:Kotsinas\, Lemnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The historic chapel of Zoodochos Pigi at Kotsinas\, by the statue of Maroula on Bournia bay\, keeps the ninth day after the Dormition with festive vespers at 19:30 on 22 August and liturgy at 07:30 on the 23rd. A quiet\, scenic feast rather than a party\; the underground spring beneath the church is the reason people come.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lemnos/#kotsinas-enniamera-of-the-virgin-at-zoodochos-pigi-kotsinas
